    {
      "id": "wj3yh_6gNx5CwtRIqJ16u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1785.1655046076967,
      "y": 6546.113247843081,
      "width": 671,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2059033012,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1386514896,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785344449486,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "notes.txt -> helloworld\n\nInternally it's different.\nLinux stores something like:\n\n    Filename -> Metadata(inode) -> Disk Blocks -> Hello World\n\nCommon File Systems\nLinux\n    ext4 (most common)\n    XFS\n    Btrfs\n\nWindows\n    NTFS\n    FAT32\n    exFAT\n\nmacOS\n    APFS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "notes.txt -> helloworld\n\nInternally it's different.\nLinux stores something like:\n\n    Filename -> Metadata(inode) -> Disk Blocks -> Hello World\n\nCommon File Systems\nLinux\n    ext4 (most common)\n    XFS\n    Btrfs\n\nWindows\n    NTFS\n    FAT32\n    exFAT\n\nmacOS\n    APFS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rTLlLWTDlCmysPJtbQNpw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2113.9272233576967,
      "y": 4489.242154093081,
      "width": 11,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
