    {
      "id": "5faAqpQUsm8nQbJ5zutb7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1856.1615983576967,
      "y": 7324.234341593081,
      "width": 462,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1809493296,
      "version": 177,
      "versionNonce": 1304204592,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785346127024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hard Link\n    filename -> inode\nSoft Link \n    filename -> Another file name -> inode\n\n\nWhat Happens if Original File is Deleted?\nHard Link\n    rm notes.txt\n    Still works.\n    Because\n        backup.txt -> inode -> data\n    The inode still has a reference.\n\nSoft Link\n    Delete notes.txt\n    Now shortcut.txt becomes broken\n    Because\n        shortcut.txt -> notes.txt(missing)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hard Link\n    filename -> inode\nSoft Link \n    filename -> Another file name -> inode\n\n\nWhat Happens if Original File is Deleted?\nHard Link\n    rm notes.txt\n    Still works.\n    Because\n        backup.txt -> inode -> data\n    The inode still has a reference.\n\nSoft Link\n    Delete notes.txt\n    Now shortcut.txt becomes broken\n    Because\n        shortcut.txt -> notes.txt(missing)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M3tnW8xCoTFB8nSAFUdQj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1902.6928483576967,
      "y": 7346.374966593081,
      "width": 11,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 768433104,
