      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why Doesn't Linux Delete the Data Immediately?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why Doesn't Linux Delete the Data Immediately?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RPu3AnPfjsKzx2hfuCMNK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1837.9311296076967,
      "y": 7926.609341593081,
      "width": 1111,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 479708624,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1359728432,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785346275284,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is a favorite interview question.\n\nSuppose\n    notes.txt -> inode\n\nCreate\n    ln notes.txt backup.txt\n    Now\n        notes.txt -> inode -> backup.txt\n\nDelete\n    rm notes.txt\n\nLinux only removes one directory entry.\nThe inode still has one remaining reference.\nOnly when all hard links are removed and no process is using the file can the filesystem reclaim its \nstorage.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is a favorite interview question.\n\nSuppose\n    notes.txt -> inode\n\nCreate\n    ln notes.txt backup.txt\n    Now\n        notes.txt -> inode -> backup.txt\n\nDelete\n    rm notes.txt\n\nLinux only removes one directory entry.\nThe inode still has one remaining reference.\nOnly when all hard links are removed and no process is using the file can the filesystem reclaim its \nstorage.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c-wNs_637EsMQ4b9TzANf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1762.4272233576967,
      "y": 8438.24215409308,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
